    "name": "implementing-api-schema-validation-security",
    "description": "Implements API schema validation using OpenAPI Specification and JSON Schema documents, enforced both at the API gateway (runtime) and during development (shift-left), to lock down request/response contracts and reject unknown properties. Use when preventing injection attacks (SQLi, XSS, XXE), blocking mass assignment, or stopping data leakage through unvalidated API responses.",
